      "content": "it's not just a mistake though. it's like... i can see the faces of the people who were hurt every time i close my eyes. it feels deeper than just a professional error. i feel like i've fundamentally changed who i am. i'm not the person i thought i was. i'm just a bad person now. how can anyone look at me and not see that?",
